    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483770/extras/1db86e491e17180e0251d8baf6000472.avif?t=1699488104\" /></span><br><br><strong>It's your first day at the job, just like any other week!</strong><br><br><i>Enter the immersive town known as Neverquit, as you follow your protagonist (and optional feline companion!) through a journey as a customer service cashier at the local Shop n' Stuff!</i> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483770/extras/d59800660abc6ea754eaf86a45805c20.avif?t=1699488104\" /></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dynamic gameplay of various elements involving action/quick-time events!<br></li><li> Old-school style RPG elements, to give you that nostalgic feeling!<br></li><li> With special gear, you can make the game into a resettable rogue-like that &quot;remembers&quot; your previous reset!<br></li><li> Unique RPG classes, such as &quot;Schrodinger&quot; -- a class that learns new abilities on game resets, and &quot;Tactician,&quot; requiring stance changes for techniques!<br></li><li> Events and scenes in the game feel like it's old school goodness, complete with retro sound effects and music!<br></li><li> An incredible soundtrack, awesome pixel-style graphics and animations!<br></li><li> A story that blossoms every time you reset or get an ending in the game, with a dynamic day-to-day system!<br></li><li> ... And <strong>more</strong>!</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483770/extras/b4267d33a2a96fd36f11324e837cd3b6.avif?t=1699488104\" /></span><br><br>Hurry up, <i>clock on in</i>, what do you have to <strong>lose</strong>?! Maybe you'll learn a thing or two about the <i>trick of the trade</i>. Buy<i> The Customer Is Always Right! </i>today!<br><br><i>You can edit in-game options with F1, such as window mode, controller support, hotkeys, and other settings such as music/sound disabling.</i>",
